      "en": "You have laid me in the lowest pit, in the darkest depths.",
      "ko": "주께서 나를 깊은 웅덩이 어두운 곳 음침한데 두셨사오며",
      "source_text_hash": "bbc7b7557abb83ed318c2e99c5c9e8121a45a791b90ac284d7a7b10c44c4eda3",
      "translation_text_hash": "4d06673115e32fd1bb448da96fba2f0985443109aff40603ee065e184bb562c9",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "주께서 나를 깊은 웅덩이 어두운 곳 음침한데 두셨사오며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "4d06673115e32fd1bb448da96fba2f0985443109aff40603ee065e184bb562c9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:PSA:88:7",
      "sequence": 15316,
      "chapter_label": "PSA 88",
      "verse_label": "7",
